# MD39a: one drive for every car, from its Desert Oasis Free Ride spawn (at rest). Cross gas, Square brake,
# Circle hand brake, left stick steer (MX Unleashed's car card; MX vs. ATV's not shown). The first right
# turn misses the palm ahead of the spawn and lines the car up with the dune jump (the buggy is in the air
# from about tick 190 to 280); then left and right steer, a brake to slow, gas, and a hand-brake turn.
sleep 15t
down cross
stick l 1 0
sleep 45t
stick l 0 0
sleep 240t
stick l -1 0
sleep 40t
stick l 0 0
sleep 20t
stick l 1 0
sleep 40t
stick l 0 0
sleep 20t
up cross
down square
sleep 90t
up square
down cross
sleep 60t
stick l -1 0
down circle
sleep 30t
up circle
stick l 0 0
sleep 90t
release
sleep 45t
